# Goal: detect/report objects belonging to object_classes, once (default)
# or continuously until canceled/preempted if `continuous` is true. Any
# perception stack (a classic detector, a VLM-based one, ...) expresses
# itself through this same interface; stack-specific knobs go in
# parameters_json.
string[] object_classes
bool continuous
float32 max_rate_hz
string parameters_json
---
# Result
# Shared result-code convention across Navigation/Manipulation/Perception
# (0-9 reserved for the shared block, capability-specific codes start at 10).
uint16 SUCCESS=0
uint16 REJECTED=1
uint16 ABORTED=2
uint16 CANCELED=3
uint16 TIMEOUT=4
uint16 error_code
string error_msg
vision_msgs/Detection3DArray detections_3d
vision_msgs/Detection2DArray detections_2d
---
# Feedback
vision_msgs/Detection3DArray detections_3d
vision_msgs/Detection2DArray detections_2d
